{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aircraft Dispatcher: Ground Operations</i> is inspired by real-world airline dispatch and ramp control. In this single-player, first-person simulation, you take command of an operations centre where you manage flights, staff, and logistics directly from your dispatch console.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/515f247fd65c1769ea9f9e1e5856b00f.poster.avif?t=1773489329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/515f247fd65c1769ea9f9e1e5856b00f.webm?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/515f247fd65c1769ea9f9e1e5856b00f.mp4?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aircraft Maintenance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to keep every flight running safely and on schedule. Manage maintenance, parts, and ground equipment while supervising ramp operations \u2014 from tugs and marshals to baggage crews, buses, and passenger stairs. Trade or transfer parts and equipment with other airlines to keep operations moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/3824e85b7ecc705827b10bf81ed5df9e.poster.avif?t=1773489329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/3824e85b7ecc705827b10bf81ed5df9e.webm?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/3824e85b7ecc705827b10bf81ed5df9e.mp4?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct taxiway operations yourself or assign them to your team. Manage recruitment and ensure staff are properly trained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/a11af77fafc49ef0af4bf280746afa3a.poster.avif?t=1773489329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/a11af77fafc49ef0af4bf280746afa3a.webm?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/a11af77fafc49ef0af4bf280746afa3a.mp4?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4110470?t=1773489329","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4110470?t=1773489329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/43dca77a64ebf3cb3ddc68f6723bd7e70ad70dbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773489329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/43dca77a64ebf3cb3ddc68f6723bd7e70ad70dbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773489329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aircraft Dispatcher: Ground Operations</i> is inspired by real-world airline dispatch and ramp control. In this single-player, first-person simulation, you take command of an operations centre where you manage flights, staff, and logistics directly from your dispatch console.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/515f247fd65c1769ea9f9e1e5856b00f.poster.avif?t=1773489329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/515f247fd65c1769ea9f9e1e5856b00f.webm?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/515f247fd65c1769ea9f9e1e5856b00f.mp4?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aircraft Maintenance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to keep every flight running safely and on schedule. Manage maintenance, parts, and ground equipment while supervising ramp operations \u2014 from tugs and marshals to baggage crews, buses, and passenger stairs. Trade or transfer parts and equipment with other airlines to keep operations moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/3824e85b7ecc705827b10bf81ed5df9e.poster.avif?t=1773489329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/3824e85b7ecc705827b10bf81ed5df9e.webm?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/3824e85b7ecc705827b10bf81ed5df9e.mp4?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct taxiway operations yourself or assign them to your team. Manage recruitment and ensure staff are properly trained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/a11af77fafc49ef0af4bf280746afa3a.poster.avif?t=1773489329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/a11af77fafc49ef0af4bf280746afa3a.webm?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/extras/a11af77fafc49ef0af4bf280746afa3a.mp4?t=1773489329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mojo Soft"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110470/7e07dc158c2b8b0fc140d3bccc35ff4173f4e0fd/header.jpg?t=1773489329","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4110470/1895973748/a4f00c0ece348cf9c14fc6f56bab57bfdb1aaa63/1760534961/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761460524","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4110470/1895973748/a4f00c0ece348cf9c14fc6f56bab57bfdb1aaa63/1760534961/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761460524","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4110470/1895973748/a4f00c0ece348cf9c14fc6f56bab57bfdb1aaa63/1760